gRR(){return"This action will permanently delete your account from this device and initiate the removal of your data from the **Nostr** network.\n\n### What will happen:\n- **Locally:** Your **private key** and all notes will be irreversibly erased from this device.\n- **On the Nostr network:** A request to delete all your notes will be sent to your relays. Most relays will honor this request.\n\n### Important to know:\nYour notes are end-to-end encrypted. Even if copies remain on some relays, they cannot be read without your private key (which was stored only in the Keychain), which is now permanently deleted."},
